        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A triple herb window hanger keeps three small 8 cm herb pots at the kitchen window on a wooden dowel or curtain rod. Each cup is worked in double crochet in the round from a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "magic ring",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "; the top edge has chain loops that thread directly onto the rod. Works well with basil, thyme, and rosemary side by side."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "items": [
